Codec Raw input and decoded output Playback example <code>OPUS/16000</code> (default) 16-bit signed little-endian PCM, 16 kHz, mono <code>ffplay -autoexit -f s16le -ar 16000 -ac 1 audio.raw</code> <code>OPUS/48000/2</code> 16-bit signed little-endian PCM, 48 kHz, stereo <code>ffplay -autoexit -f s16le -ar 48000 -ac 2 audio.raw</code> <code>PCMU/8000</code> 8-bit mu-law, 8 kHz, mono <code>ffplay -autoexit -f mulaw -ar 8000 -ac 1 audio.raw</code> <p>Set the codec during construction:</p> <pre><code>const softphone = new Softphone({
  // SIP credentials...
  codec: "PCMU/8000",
});
</code></pre>
